WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.760
Here's an overview of the changes
we're going to be making to Sunshine.

00:00:03.760 --> 00:00:07.700
We'll continue to refer to this map
as we move these coding exercises.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.260
There are lots of terms in this map
that we haven't discussed before

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:15.720
such as database contract,
content provider, and DB Helper.

00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.820
Each one of these blocks represents
a section of our modular

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.720
data storage solution.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.560
We start by defining our data
storage in terms of a contract.

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.850
We then implement
the database using SQLite.

00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:32.390
And finally, we layer a fundamental
Android class between our UI and

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:35.160
the data storage called
a content provider.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:40.100
Ultimately, building our data storage
in this way allows Sunshine to leverage

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:42.150
powerful Android frameworks.

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:46.270
We'll explain all of this in more
detail as we implement each section.

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:47.010
Let's get started.

